[06:59] CANDIDATE: Honestly we only had a versioned event name and a TypeScript types package, so a breaking change would show up at build time for remotes that upgraded, but not for ones that hadn't. If I did it again I'd add a runtime schema check in the shell and keep the old event shape for one release so teams can migrate gradually.
